# Prevent Git from rewriting line endings inside binary files. Without this,
# a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true silently corrupts .pkl/.png
# files byte-for-byte (CRLF conversion applied where it shouldn't be) -
# this bit us once already: crispr_xgb_calibrated.pkl loaded as
# "input stream corrupted" after a fresh Windows clone/pull.
*.pkl binary
*.pickle binary
*.joblib binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.parquet binary
*.npz binary
*.npy binary